    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（中甲），珍稀（需同調）</em><br />這套色彩鮮豔、花團錦簇的護甲鑄成於 <strong>妖精荒野Feywild</strong> 之中，它充滿着那個奇幻位面的誘人能量。<br />穿着這套護甲期間，你爲防止陷入或結束 <strong>魅惑&amp;Reference[condition=charmed]</strong> 狀態所做的豁免具有優勢。<br />這套護甲具有3發充能。你可以消耗一發充能以用其施展法術<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.RpBbOYseLZCFXaFY]{強迫術 Compulsion}</em>（豁免DC15）。這套護甲在每日黎明時分恢復[[/r 1d3]]發已消耗的充能數。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm 10pt\"><span class=\"GramE\">該護甲</span>主要由皮條固定的金屬護胸組成。儘管它並沒有爲四肢提供額外的防護，但其在保證着裝者活動自由度的同時，爲其生命器官提供了十分有效的保護效果。</p></div></div><p>This colorful, flowery armor was forged in the Feywild and is infused with that plane's captivating magic.</p><p>While wearing this armor, you have advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the &amp;Reference[condition=charmed] condition on yourself.</p><p>This armor has 3 charges. You can use an action to expend a charge to cast the @spell[Compulsion] spell (save DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">15</span>) from this armor. The armor regains [[/r 1d3]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>This armor consists of a fitted metal chest piece worn with supple leather. Although it leaves the legs and arms relatively unprotected, this armor provides good protection for the wearer's vital organs while leaving the wearer relatively unencumbered.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
